    "extraction_notes": [
      "P-channel signed voltages and currents are stored as positive magnitudes in numeric fields; original negative signs are retained in conditions and source-axis labels.",
      "The datasheet publishes IDSS max 1.0e-6 A at VDS = -24 V and VGS = 0 V, IGSS max +/-100 nA at VGS = +/-20 V and VDS = 0 V, and gfs min 5.5 S and typ 8.2 S at VDS = -5 V and ID = -4.0 A; these fields are not represented by the supplied schema.",
      "The datasheet publishes Qg typ 12 nC, Qgs typ 2.0 nC, Qgd typ 2.0 nC at VGS = -10 V, VDS = -15 V, and ID = -4.1 A; the gate-charge figure is included as a curve, while the tabulated charge fields are not represented by the supplied schema.",
      "The datasheet publishes tD(on) typ 4.0 ns, tr typ 18 ns, tD(off) typ 18 ns, and tf typ 22 ns; timing fields are not represented by the supplied schema.",
      "Thermal resistance RthetaJA is 105 degC/W maximum for the stated FR-4 board mounting condition; RthetaJC is not published and thermal fields are not represented by the supplied schema.",
      "Figures 4, 7, 8, and 9 were examined but are not included as model-input curves because the supplied schema has no temperature-coefficient, safe-operating-area, drain-current-versus-temperature, or transient-thermal-impedance fields."
    ],
